{ BLOCK6 OF EDITOR }  <H>
SWITCH: `EF WHAT?   kaA -: `ALT    kLEFT -: `<-    kUP -: `L_UP
 kHOME -: `L_BEG   kEND -: `L_END  kPGUP -: `B   kPGDN -: `N
